  "overview": "Italia Design System — Crisp light (#fff) canvas, Titillium Web typography, #06c brand accent, and 8px corner geometry",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#fff) canvas paired with `#fff` component surfaces and `#333` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#06c` with `#ffffff` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `Titillium Web` across 13 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`8px`), cards (`12px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
